OL,3,GNEWSABingo hall plan approved for empty
OL,4,Acity centre shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 40 jobs are set to be created
OL,7,Fafter plans for a new bingo hall in a
OL,8,Fshopping centre were approved.
OL,10,FClub 3000's proposals are to transform
OL,11,Fthe former TK Maxx unit at The Bridges
OL,12,FShopping Centre in Sunderland, which
OL,13,Fhas been empty since the company moved
OL,14,Fto a new location in the city in
OL,15,FFebruary.
OL,17,FSunderland City Council officers said
OL,18,Fthe creation of dozens of jobs would
OL,19,F"make a significant positive
OL,20,Fcontribution to the vitality and
OL,21,Fvibrancy of the city centre".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
