OL,3,GNEWSABingo hall plan approved for empty
OL,4,Acity centre shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe site is expected to be Club 3000's
OL,7,F25th premises in the UK and its second
OL,8,Fin the North East, alongside its
OL,9,Fexisting Peterlee venue, and the
OL,10,Fcompany hopes the new venue will open
OL,11,Fin early 2027, subject to relevant
OL,12,Fpermissions.
